  "description": "Broke and hungry, Park Tae-Ho never expected a random delivery of potatoes to lead him to the quiet village of Hongwol-ri, where he is forced into a farming showdown with his wealthy enemy, Hyeon Seung-Ju. Tilling fields by day and sharing a roof by night, their chaotic rural life is filled with non-stop bickering. But as physical closeness breeds emotional sparks, Tae-Ho realizes his biggest challenge isn't farming, it's resisting his rival.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
